  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis recipe is based on my own style of photography, which often has a deep, vintage look. It produces strong, distinctive colors but is highly versatile. It can be used whether shooting in the daytime, capturing night portraits, or taking photos in coffee shops and other indoor situations. Manually adjusting white balance to achieve slightly warmer colors makes it easy to create the ideal look. This recipe produces colors with a vintage feel, so try it in retro coffee shops and locations, and with fashion photography.\n",
